1. Download the repo
2. Run cmd as admin
3. Navigate to the backend directory and run: `npm install`
4. Navigate to the frontend directory and run: `npm install`
5. Navigate to the application root directory and run: `npm install`
5. In the root directory and run: `npm run dist`
	a. This will give you a dist folder in the root
	b. In that dist folder you will find the .exe installer for the application
